      "id": "clm:1d21ead8b6ff8f2e6601756fe95d446a23104aae5c1b0c0a4337c937c01801a0",
      "text": "Aave v3 health factor is the liquidation-threshold-weighted collateral value divided by total debt value: HF = \u03a3(collateral_value_i \u00d7 LT_i) / \u03a3(debt_value_j). A position with HF below 1 can be liquidated. Aave's own example: $10,000 of ETH at an 80% liquidation threshold with $6,000 of GHO borrowed gives HF 1.333. Aave Governance sets the liquidation threshold per collateral asset. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://aave.com/help/borrowing/liquidations",
